OL,3,GNEWSASenedd presiding officer accuses
OL,4,AReform MS of offensive comments in
OL,5,AWelsh Gender Service debate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Senedd's presiding officer has
OL,8,Faccused a Reform MS of making offensive
OL,9,Fremarks in a debate about the
OL,10,Fcrisis-hit Welsh Gender Service (WGS).
OL,12,FJoe Martin said the service should be
OL,13,Fshut down and the "butchers" and
OL,14,F"liars" responsible for surgery on
OL,15,Fchildren should be jailed.
OL,17,FThe WGS provides services to adults
OL,18,Faged 18 and over identifying as
OL,19,Ftransgender - Martin did not specify
OL,20,Fthe cases he was referring to.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
